      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Все включённые зоны показаны одновременно. **Синие точечные окружности** — радиусы зон; **оранжевые точечные** — пороги выхода с запасом max(50 м, 25% радиуса). **Фиолетовые точки с названиями** — центры; **зелёная** — последняя пригодная Android GPS-точка (её возраст указан ниже). Масштаб автоматически охватывает все зоны; далёкую GPS-точку можно увидеть, отдалив карту.\n\nВход: расстояние + погрешность ≤ радиуса. Выход: расстояние − погрешность ≥ оранжевого порога. Нужны повторные измерения в течение времени подтверждения. Карта и таблица обновляются каждые 30 секунд."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "geomap",
      "title": "Все зоны · границы и позиция",
      "description": "Все включённые зоны без выбора места. Каждая окружность — замкнутый ряд из 361 геодезической вершины (радиус Земли 6371000 м). Контур показан мелкими маркерами: разные зоны не соединяются линиями. Автомасштаб по порогам выхода всех зон; GPS-точка не влияет на масштаб.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "eftexe5xy5hxca"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "eftexe5xy5hxca"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "-- Each zone has its own closed ring of geodesic vertices.\n-- Small markers draw the contour without connecting different zones.\nWITH place AS (\n    SELECT id, name, radius_m AS boundary_radius_m,\n           radians(latitude) AS lat, radians(longitude) AS lon,\n           (radius_m) / 6371000.0 AS delta\n    FROM public.geo_places\n    WHERE enabled\n), points AS (\n    SELECT p.*, step, radians(step::double precision) AS bearing\n    FROM place p CROSS JOIN generate_series(0, 360) AS step\n), destinations AS (\n    SELECT *, asin(least(1.0, greatest(-1.0,\n        sin(lat)*cos(delta) + cos(lat)*sin(delta)*cos(bearing)\n    ))) AS dest_lat\n    FROM points\n), coordinates AS (\n    SELECT id, name, boundary_radius_m, step, degrees(dest_lat) AS latitude,\n           degrees(lon + atan2(sin(bearing)*sin(delta)*cos(lat),\n                              cos(delta)-sin(lat)*sin(dest_lat))) AS longitude\n    FROM destinations\n)\nSELECT id::text, name, boundary_radius_m, step, latitude, longitude\nFROM coordinates\nORDER BY id, step;"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "eftexe5xy5hxca"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "-- Each zone has its own closed ring of geodesic vertices.\n-- Small markers draw the contour without connecting different zones.\nWITH place AS (\n    SELECT id, name, radius_m + greatest(50.0, radius_m*0.25) AS boundary_radius_m,\n           radians(latitude) AS lat, radians(longitude) AS lon,\n           (radius_m + greatest(50.0, radius_m*0.25)) / 6371000.0 AS delta\n    FROM public.geo_places\n    WHERE enabled\n), points AS (\n    SELECT p.*, step, radians(step::double precision) AS bearing\n    FROM place p CROSS JOIN generate_series(0, 360) AS step\n), destinations AS (\n    SELECT *, asin(least(1.0, greatest(-1.0,\n        sin(lat)*cos(delta) + cos(lat)*sin(delta)*cos(bearing)\n    ))) AS dest_lat\n    FROM points\n), coordinates AS (\n    SELECT id, name, boundary_radius_m, step, degrees(dest_lat) AS latitude,\n           degrees(lon + atan2(sin(bearing)*sin(delta)*cos(lat),\n                              cos(delta)-sin(lat)*sin(dest_lat))) AS longitude\n    FROM destinations\n)\nSELECT id::text, name, boundary_radius_m, step, latitude, longitude\nFROM coordinates\nORDER BY id, step;"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "eftexe5xy5hxca"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT id::text, name, latitude, longitude, radius_m, confirmation_seconds\nFROM public.geo_places\nWHERE enabled\nORDER BY name, id;"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "eftexe5xy5hxca"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT recorded_at, latitude, longitude, accuracy AS accuracy_m,\n       extract(epoch FROM now()-recorded_at) AS age_seconds\nFROM public.locations\nWHERE source = 'android' AND NOT hidden AND quality_reason = ''\n  AND accuracy > 0 AND accuracy <= 100\nORDER BY recorded_at DESC, id DESC\nLIMIT 1;"
        }
      ],
